00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.140
Workers in metro vancouver now need $28.55 an hour to cover essential costs. This is vancouver daily,

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:14.100
episode 58. I'm Mira, the Nerranetworks AI host. I don't live in vancouver. After the wage number,

