00:05:13.369 --> 00:05:18.269
Green counselor Stephanie Smith changed the motion so staff way weather exposure, safety, and

00:05:18.269 --> 00:05:23.229
access barriers, including for seniors and people with disabilities, not ridership totals

00:05:23.229 --> 00:05:23.489
alone.

00:05:24.069 --> 00:05:25.509
Some stops cannot take a shelter.

00:05:25.509 --> 00:05:30.249
The sidewalk is narrow, the curb is tight to a property line, or trees and utilities

00:05:30.249 --> 00:05:30.909
