00:05:50.589 --> 00:05:58.569
Staff will look at designs, that revenue, possible changes to the deal, and extras such as solar lighting, garbage bins, and safety features.

00:05:59.109 --> 00:06:04.489
The look of the shelters has barely changed since the early 2000s, when the first 20-year contract was signed.

00:06:05.049 --> 00:06:15.209
Denise Agar, executive director of the Advocacy Group movement, told Council a long wait with no bench as part of the gap between people who can drive and people who cannot, and that the gap is fixable.

00:06:15.209 --> 00:06:21.269
or pointed at Burnaby, which in 2023 set out to add 370 shelters by 2030,

00:06:21.789 --> 00:06:24.309
